ions. It can be bought at the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $8,994.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<p>There are 6 variants of THE OAK PIECE, ranging from common to rare. The exact chance for each variant is unknown.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"b9e02343af1af73f9c704c4b3d1e250f\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"OakPiece1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:OakPiece1.png\" title=\"OakPiece1.png (114 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/OakPiece1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240402183314\" title=\"OakPiece1.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"A Black and Gold Variant.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"OakPiece1.png\" data-image-key=\"OakPiece1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A Black and Gold Variant.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"OakPiece1.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"A Black and Gold Variant.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"OakPiece1.png\" data-image-key=\"OakPiece1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A Black and Gold Variant.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/OakPiece1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240402183314\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">A Bl